urther complicated by a troubling history of previous arrests for assault and property damage.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hawaii-congressional-candidate-kirill-basin-allegedly-threatened-beachgoers-in-maui-after-being-knocked-unconscious-he-was-charged-and-held-on-1-million-bail/articleshow/133012564.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/hawaii-congressional-candidate-kirill-basin-allegedly-threatened-beachgoers-in-maui-after-being-knocked-unconscious-he-was-charged-and-held-on-1-million-bail/articleshow/133012564.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-07T01:18:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133012564,imgsize-629255.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['USCIS makes mistakes': Immigration expert breaks down new H-1B, Green Card rule, calls its another step in dismantling legal immigration]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133014967.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/uscis-makes-mistakes-immigration-expert-breaks-down-new-h-1b-green-card-rule-calls-its-another-step-in-dismantling-legal-immigration/articleshow/133014967.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/uscis-makes-mistakes-immigration-expert-breaks-down-new-h-1b-green-card-rule-calls-its-another-step-in-dismantling-legal-immigration/articleshow/133014967.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-07T00:37:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133014992,imgsize-64599.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Michael Fassbender: "I've always been more inclined to