sts losing biomass fast; carbon sink weakened by drought, beetles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133011192.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/since-2018-europes-forests-have-lost-46-more-biomass-per-hectare-each-year-drought-and-bark-beetles-are-weakening-a-carbon-sink-that-stored-72-less-co2-in-20202022/articleshow/133011192.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/since-2018-europes-forests-have-lost-46-more-biomass-per-hectare-each-year-drought-and-bark-beetles-are-weakening-a-carbon-sink-that-stored-72-less-co2-in-20202022/articleshow/133011192.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-06T21:56:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133011284,imgsize-206765.cms"/></item></channel></rss>